## Solar-assisted photocatalytic water splitting using defective UiO-66 solids from modulated synthesis
Celia M. Rueda-Navarro<sup>1</sup>, María Cabrero-Antonino<sup>1</sup>, Paula Escamilla<sup>2</sup>, Valentín Díez-Cabanes<sup>3</sup>, Dong Fan<sup>3</sup>, Pedro Atienzar<sup>4</sup>, Belén Ferrer<sup>1</sup>, Ignacio Vayá<sup>1,4</sup>, Guillaume Maurin<sup>3</sup>, Herme G. Baldoví<sup>1</sup> (✉), and Sergio Navalón<sup>1</sup> (✉)
